            {
                "entry_id": "2f6a0259-1247-3262-b9d3-ea4d07a49b41",
                "word": "allo",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "291f17b1-a1ca-4f08-8784-f5f72307d592",
                        "entry_id": "2f6a0259-1247-3262-b9d3-ea4d07a49b41",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "allos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "eb3d679b-3cf7-3eac-ad11-6f5ddd2ee547",
                        "entry_id": "2f6a0259-1247-3262-b9d3-ea4d07a49b41",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who is allosexual and/or alloromantic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f37d8dc4-2ab3-4c0f-9ac3-e5468847c2ad",
                                "sense_id": "eb3d679b-3cf7-3eac-ad11-6f5ddd2ee547",
                                "text": "Allos might feel infatuated with a new acquaintance or be more attached to their best friend than to any romantic partner, yet they can deny the possibility of romantic feeling because of the lack of sexual attraction. Allos can wave their hand and say, \"There are people I want to sleep with, and I don't want to sleep with you, so it's only platonic.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9754f48b-c7b1-4f9c-a137-fadde7d35b68",
                                "sense_id": "eb3d679b-3cf7-3eac-ad11-6f5ddd2ee547",
                                "text": "Then maybe asexuals wouldn't face negative responses (\"You're a late bloomer\" or You haven't met the right person\" etc.) when they come out to allos."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2421de28-ff8a-4105-a39e-a8769d8693c8",
                                "sense_id": "eb3d679b-3cf7-3eac-ad11-6f5ddd2ee547",
                                "text": "Part of why I’m writing this essay is to tell allos we exist, to make them aware of our struggle and our pain."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
